WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:01.601
The story of an actor on

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.402
a hit TV show,

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.604
a member of the Church of Scientology

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.107
and three former church members

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.942
who say he raped them.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.010
Danny Masterson,

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.011
best known for his role

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.711
as Steven Hyde

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.712
on that 70 show,

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:13.747
which aired on Fox

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.815
for eight seasons, ending in 2006.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.918
Now 47, Masterson was convicted in

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.487
May of raping two women

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:21.121
at his home

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.255
in separate incidents

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.391
between 2001 and 2003.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.226
The jury deadlocked on the rape charge

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:28.862
involving the third woman on Thursday.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.363
Yesterday, Masterson,

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.431
who continues to deny

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.100
the allegations, was sentenced to prison.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.603
30 years to life.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.405
Masterson's attorney

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.739
say he will appeal the convictions

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:41.875
but there is more to this story.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.010
Questions about the role

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.212
of the Church of Scientology

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.648
and whether it played any role

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.082
in why

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:51.017
justice was so long

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:53.086
in coming in this case.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:53.987
Scientology, a

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:56.222
relatively new religion, is secretive

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.724
and litigious

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.259
and has regularly found

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.327
its legitimate challenge,

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.328
including opposition

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.230
from the medical community to its claims

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:04.964
about mental

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.467
health and e meters devices

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.902
that supposedly monitor

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.303
the body's electric flow.

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:12.205
While so-called auditors

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:13.206
ask would be members

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.375
questions to discover sources of trauma.

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.477
The Scientology connection

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:18.411
is important here because,

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:18.845
as Rolling

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:20.113
Stone reported,

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.182
witnesses testified at the trial

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.750
that Scientology

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.952
has an expressly written doctrine

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:27.787
that not only discourages

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.956
but prohibits its members

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.357
from reporting one

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.593
another to law enforcement.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:34.828
Now, during their testimony

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:35.628
and at the sentencing,

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.630
as well as in separate civil lawsuits,

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.966
Masterson's accusers said

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.501
that church officials

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.369
tried to silence them

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.672
and cover up for Danny Masterson.

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:46.539
During the trial,

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.607
Variety reported

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.741
that the women claimed, quote,

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.410
The church dissuaded them

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.545
from reporting Masterson to the police.

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:54.380
Prosecutors argued throughout the trial

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.116
that Masterson had taken advantage

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.450
of his position in the church

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.618
to rape women

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.487
without fear of repercussion,

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.722
and that the church forbid women

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:03.790
from going to the police

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.959
to report sexual assault, unquote.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.160
The Los Angeles Times says

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.561
during closing arguments,

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.662
prosecutor Ariel

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.231
Manson told the jury, quote,

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:12.298
The church tells

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.501
his victims rape isn't rape.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:16.369
You caused this.

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:17.070
And above all,

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.907
you can't go to law enforcement, unquote.

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.276
Hours after Masterson

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:25.145
sentencing, the Church of Scientology

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.514
responded by rereleasing its statement

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:28.982
from the day of his conviction in May.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.582
It says in part,

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:31.317
There's not a scintilla of evidence

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.119
supporting the scandalous allegations

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:34.888
that the church harassed the accusers.

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:37.223
The church has no policy prohibiting

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.158
or discouraging members

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.392
from reporting criminal conduct

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.060
of anyone, unquote.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.629
Among those in the courtroom yesterday

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:44.330
to support the women,

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.899
actress and advocate

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:47.400
Leah Remini, a former member

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.035
of the Church of Scientology

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:51.437
who has been an outspoken critic.

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:52.272
She joins us now

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:53.840
with Mike Render,

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.542
a former Church of Scientology

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:56.643
senior executive

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:59.045
and remedies co-host, of the podcast

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:00.046
Fair Game.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.414
Thanks to both of you for being here.

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:02.315
Leah, let me start with you.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.216
Variety reports

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:04.817
that one of the accusers identified

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.320
as Jane Doe number one testified, quote,

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:09.889
My understanding from Scientology

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:10.924
my entire life was

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:12.292
that you can never be a victim.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.593
Nothing ever happens to you

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:14.494
that you didn't

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:16.496
cause no matter what condition

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:18.631
you find yourself in life,

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:19.566
no matter how horrible

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.366
you are

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:23.403
responsible, you created that, unquote.

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:27.207
Do you see Scientology itself on

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:29.042
trial here in any way?

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:32.011
Well, it's not

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.213
well, it should be on trial.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.447
They should have been a codefendant

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:35.848
in this case.

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:36.983
Yes.

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:40.019
Scientology policy is

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:40.920
should be looked at.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.089
Unfortunately, they have tax exemption.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:44.424
But however,

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:46.192
this is absolutely true.

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:47.093
It's absolutely law.

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:49.395
It's absolutely policy of Scientology.

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.197
I was a Scientologist most of my life.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.098
And Mike,

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:52.832
the former

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:55.802
head of the Office of Special Affairs,

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:58.037
And that is not her understanding.

00:03:58.037 --> 00:03:59.839
That is the law of Scientology.

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:02.942
We are not allowed to report crimes

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:04.310
to the authorities.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.613
We're not allowed to sue each other.

00:04:06.613 --> 00:04:08.848
So that's absolute law.

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:11.217
And when you watched the trial, Leah,

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:14.988
what was that experience like?

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:17.190
It was heartbreaking.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.225
I've been involved

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:21.461
supporting the Jane Doe as well, Mike,

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:23.796
for seven years.

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:25.531
I've had my own experiences with it.

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:27.567
This is one story out of thousands.

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:28.501
If not,

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:29.269
I mean,

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:30.336
I don't want to

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:30.937
anybody think

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:31.771
I'm being

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:32.005
you know,

00:04:32.005 --> 00:04:34.741
I'm exaggerating for for any reason.

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.809
But to tell the truth, however,

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:39.112
this is just one of many cases

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:40.847
that Scientology has been involved

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:43.182
in, in attempting to obstruct justice.

00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:46.052
And Mike, could also speak to that.

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:47.020
But it's the absolute

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.622
policy of Scientology. And

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.659
I think they should be held accountable,

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:56.596
which is some of the basis of my lawsuit,

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.332
so that people can come forward,

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:00.600
victims can come forward,

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.635
people are allowed to

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:05.805
report crimes concerning Scientologists,

00:05:06.205 --> 00:05:08.408
sue members, as well as,

00:05:08.408 --> 00:05:10.543
you know, civilian Scientologists.

00:05:10.543 --> 00:05:12.912
People should not be in fear

00:05:12.912 --> 00:05:13.946
of retaliation.

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:15.615
For a multi billion

00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:17.483
dollar organization calling itself

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.785
the church

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:22.188
for fear of what they do to people

